    "Name": "Dragon DRG-5ALAG",
    "Details": "The DRG-5ALAG is the Amphigean Light Assault Group's take on improving the previous Dragon DRG-1ALAG with the updates introduced by the DRG-5N for their purposes. By replacing the AC/10 with a Gauss Rifle they found it considerably more useful due its increased range, while also allowing for more colling and two more lasers. The success of this variant eventually led to parts of the DRG-7N design.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
